centre is one of the 17 research centres comprising Tanzania Agricultural Research&nbsp; Institute (TARI). It was established in the year 1972, the centre is mandated to undertake research on Sorghum and Millets ranging from agronomy, breeding, protection, post - harvest processing/value addition.The centre is located at Dodoma city 46 km from city centre along Dar es Salaam road.</p><p><img src=\"https://www.tari.go.tz/assets/uploads/photo/IMG-20201221-WA0128.jpg\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p>','<p>CENTRE MANAGER,</p><p>TARI HOMBOLO,</p><p>BOX 299 - DODOMA</p><p><b><i>Email: cmhombolo@tari.go.tz</i></b></p><p><b><i>Website:www.tari.go.tz</i></b><br></p><p> </p><p><br></p>','publish',7,1,'2020-11-21 00:00:00',NULL),(16,'TARI Kifyulilo','tari-kifyulilo',0,'<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">TARI-Kifyulilo\r\nwas acquired by the Government of Tanzania from a German National, Mr. W. Voigt\r\nin July, 1986; The Germany owned the land for sixty years (1926 to 1986). This\r\nInstitution started in July 1986 as a Tea Research Institute under TARO. In\r\n1998 the Institute started to do research on other crops such as Round potato,\r\nbeans and maize apart from tea which was mandated to TRIT from 1996 to date.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Location</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nWingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Lat.\r\n08<sup>0</sup> 42’ S and Long. 35<sup>0</sup> 20’ E</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nWingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Location: <span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;</span>It is\r\n150 km from Iringa Township and 33 km from South of Nyororo.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nWingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Rainfall:\r\n1000 to 1500mm.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nWingding