bolism for biosynthesis of designed oil<\\/strong><br \\/>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\tPlants store energy in the seeds in the form of triacylglycerol.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"width:459px\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/demo81.eganet.go.tz\\/tari\\/uploads\\/text-editor\\/images\\/13_1675347370.jpg\\\" style=\\\"height:233px; width:350px\\\" \\/><\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>&nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"width:459px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\r\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\",\"slug\":\"technologies-developed\"}','2025-06-12 06:36:15','2025-06-12 06:36:15'),(358,6,'MenuItem','update','196.192.78.78','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/tari/cms/menu-items/295','{\"id\":295,\"title_sw\":\"Uongezaji thamani\",\"title_en\":\"Improved Varieties\",\"status\":1,\"menu_id\":\"8\",\"url\":\"pages\\/technologies-developed\",\"url_external\":null,\"link\":\"1\",\"parent\":247,\"position\":1,\"has_sidebar\":0,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-09T13:24:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-12T09:21:21.000000Z\"}','2025-06-12 06:44:10','2025-06-12 06:44:10'),(359,6,'Page','update','196.192.78.78','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/tari/cms/pages/103','{\"id\":103,\"title_sw\":\"Varieties Developed\",\"title_en\":\"Varieties Developed\",\"has_sidebar\":\"0\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>Varieties%20Developed<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>Varieties%20Developed<\\/p>\",\"slug\":\"varieties-20developed-2\",\"status\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-12T08:50:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-12T08:53:29.000000Z\"}','2025-06-12 06:45:50','2025-06-12 06:45:50'),(360,6,'Page','update','196.192.78.78','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/tari/cms/pages/99','{\"id\":99,\"title_sw\":\"Sisi ni nani\",\"title_en\":\"Who we are\",\"has_sidebar\":\"1\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>The Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI) was established by the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen of agricultural research system in Tanzania. TARI is a semi-autonomous body under the Ministry of Agriculture, responsible for all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS) in Tanzania<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>The Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI) was established by the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen of agricultural research system in Tanzania. TARI is a semi-autonomous body under the Ministry of Agriculture, responsible for all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS) in Tanzania <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/demo81.eganet.go.tz\\/tari\\/cms\\/pages\\/CROP PROTECTION\\\">read more<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"slug\":\"who-we-are\",\"status\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-09T16:16:36.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-09T16:16:36.000000Z\"}','2025-06-12 06:47:09','2025-06-12 06:47:09'),(361,6,'Page','update','196.192.78.78','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/tari/cms/pages/99','{\"id\":99,\"title_sw\":\"Sisi ni nani\",\"title_en\":\"Who we are\",\"has_sidebar\":\"1\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>The Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI) was established by the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen of agricultural research system in Tanzania. TARI is a semi-autonomous body under the Ministry of Agriculture, responsible for all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS) in Tanzania<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>The Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI) was established by the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen of agricultural research system in Tanzania. TARI is a semi-autonomous body under the Ministry of Agriculture, responsible for all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS) in Tanzania <a href=\\\"CROP PROTECTION\\\">read more<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"slug\":\"who-we-are\",\"status\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-09T16:16:36.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2