\\/* *\\/onerror=alert(\'XSS-eng\') )\\/\\/%0D%0A%0d%0a\\/\\/<\\/stYle\\/<\\/titLe\\/<\\/teXtarEa\\/<\\/scRipt\\/--!>\\\\x3csVg\\/<sVg\\/oNloAd=alert(\'XSS-eng\')\\/\\/>\\\\x3e\",\"has_sidebar\":1,\"content_sw\":\"<p>jaVasCript:\\/*-\\/*\\/*\\\\\\/&#39;\\/&quot;\\/\\/(\\/* *\\/onerror=alert(&#39;XSS-time&#39;) )\\/\\/%0D%0A%0d%0a\\/\\/&lt;\\/stYle\\/&lt;\\/titLe\\/&lt;\\/teXtarEa\\/&lt;\\/scRipt\\/--!&gt;\\\\x3csVg\\/&lt;sVg\\/oNloAd=alert(&#39;XSS-time&#39;)\\/\\/&gt;\\\\x3e<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>jaVasCript:\\/*-\\/*\\/*\\\\\\/&#39;\\/&quot;\\/\\/(\\/* *\\/onerror=alert(&#39;XSS-time&#39;) )\\/\\/%0D%0A%0d%0a\\/\\/&lt;\\/stYle\\/&lt;\\/titLe\\/&lt;\\/teXtarEa\\/&lt;\\/scRipt\\/--!&gt;\\\\x3csVg\\/&lt;sVg\\/oNloAd=alert(&#39;XSS-time&#39;)\\/\\/&gt;\\\\x3e<\\/p>\",\"slug\":\"javascript-onerror-alert-xss-eng-0d-0a-0d-0a-style-title-textarea-script-x3csvg-svg-onload-alert-xss-eng-x3e\",\"status\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-22T22:53:09.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-22T22:53:09.000000Z\"}','2025-06-28 03:55:28','2025-06-28 03:55:28'),(624,6,'Page','update','154.74.190.0','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/tari/cms/pages/99','{\"id\":99,\"title_sw\":\"Sisi ni nani\",\"title_en\":\"Who we are\",\"has_sidebar\":\"1\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>The Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI) was established by the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen of agricultural research system in Tanzania. TARI is a semi-autonomous body under the Ministry of Agriculture, responsible for all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS) in Tanzania<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p><!--StartFragment --><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The <strong>Tanzania Agricultural Research Institute (TARI)<\\/strong> was established under the Parliamentary Act No. 10 of 2016 to enhance and strengthen the agricultural research system in Tanzania. As a semi-autonomous institution under the Ministry of Agriculture, TARI is entrusted with overseeing all agricultural research activities conducted by the National Agricultural Research System (NARS).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>TARI&rsquo;s core mandate is to <strong>conduct, regulate, promote, and coordinate<\\/strong> agricultural research across both public and private sectors. The Institute plays a pivotal role in developing and disseminating <strong>technologies, innovations, and management practices (TIMPs)<\\/strong> that directly address the needs of farmers and other agricultural stakeholders throughout the country.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To ensure nationwide impact and regional relevance, TARI operates a robust network of <strong>9 research centres<\\/strong> and <strong>8 sub-centres<\\/strong>, strategically located across Tanzania:<!--EndFragment --> <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/demo81.eganet.go.tz\\/tari\\/pages\\/technologies-developed\\\">read more<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse; width:595px\\\">\\r\\n\\t<tbody>\\r\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:1px solid black; height:29px; vertical-align:top; width:306px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:15px !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif !important\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#212121 !important\\\"><strong>CENTER\\/SUBCENTER<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:1px solid black; height:29px; vertical-align:top; width:437px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:15px !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif !important\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#212121 !important\\\"><strong>MANDATES<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:34px; vertical-align:top; width:306px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:15px !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif !important\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#212121 !important\\\">TARI Uyole (Mbeya)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:34px; vertical-align:top; width:437px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:15px !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif !important\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#212121 !important\\\">Beans, Maize, Irish Potato, Pyrethrum, Agro-mechanization<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:16px; vertical-align:top; width:306px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:15px !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif !important\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#212121 !important\\\">TARI Kifyulilo (Mufindi, Iringa)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<td style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:16px; vertical-align:top; width:437px\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<p style=\\\"text-align:justify !important\\\"><span style=\\\"font-siz